WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,680
Brother Fang Han, these bamboos

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:03,240
We came out all night last night

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:08,280
See if it works for you

4
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,200
But the hole should be dug deeper

5
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:11,920
Otherwise, I'm afraid I won't be able to die like this.

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,160
Your brother and I will dig a hole

7
00:00:13,320 --> 00:00:16,280
When you and Meiko-san go to chop down trees, just chop them nearby and don’t go too far.

8
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:17,400
OK no problem

9
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,840
Well, thank you, brothers and sisters.

10
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,160
Brother, where should we dig?

11
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:28,630
Let's dig up the front door of your house. That's right.

12
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,550
At present, the priority is to protect one’s own safety

13
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,230
If the hole is dug to the gate

14
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:35,310
As soon as the group of ten comes, they will fall and be stabbed to death by bamboo.

15
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:38,860
We are forced to fall down by ourselves. It is very simple.

16
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:40,660
Use some colored jiangguo

17
00:00:40,860 --> 00:00:41,940
Writing on the wooden house wall

18
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:44,700
Write "There is a trap in front of the door" in a larger size.

19
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,100
I can see it every time I come back

20
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:47,780
Write the same thing on the back of the door

21
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:50,180
In this way, it doesn’t matter whether you come back or go out

22
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,660
Everyone will see it immediately and the group of ten

23
00:00:52,900 --> 00:01:01,500
I don't think he can read, so it doesn't matter. Brother, I'll dig up Sister Ming'er right now.

24
00:01:01,740 --> 00:01:03,380
If you're tired, just take a break and I'll come.
